<title>USA: Donaldson Lufkin offering preferred.</title>
<headline>Donaldson Lufkin offering preferred.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Inc said Wednesday it is offering $200 million in Series A fixed, adjustable rate cumulative preferred stock.</p>
<p>The company said four million shares were being offered with a liquidation price of $50 per share which are non-callable for five years.</p>
<p>Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette said it will use net proceeds from the sale to reduce short-term debt.</p>
</text>
